            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "Mushroom meat... Hee-hee... A mushroom meal in my tummy, small mushrooms, mushroom creatures, big mushrooms... Hee-hee...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570402"
            ]
          },
          "710570402": {
            "id": "710570402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Uncle He? What's happened to your face?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570403"
            ]
          },
          "710570403": {
            "id": "710570403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "*sigh*... I knew you were alive! To think that your family even invited me to your funeral! I refused to go, you know. Told them that nothing was certain yet without a body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570404"
            ]
          },
          "710570404": {
            "id": "710570404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Look at your face. It must've been tough for you, being trapped in the mine like that. But anyway, I'm glad that you're still alive!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570405"
            ]
          },
          "710570405": {
            "id": "710570405",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "Being alive is good, yes! Living, breathing mushrooms are delicious! Hee-hee...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570406"
            ]
          },
          "710570406": {
            "id": "710570406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Uncle He?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570407"
            ]
          },
          "710570407": {
            "id": "710570407",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He was like this when we found him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570408"
            ]
          },
          "710570408": {
            "id": "710570408",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He wasn't quite all there... and he kept saying that he wanted to eat mushrooms.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570409"
            ]
          },
          "710570409": {
            "id": "710570409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Mushrooms...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570410"
            ]
          },
          "710570410": {
            "id": "710570410",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "The Chasm is a dangerous place for ordinary people. Plants and fungi growing here could also be harmful to the human body. That's why Huishan Hall has set strict rules against eating these things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570411"
            ]
          },
          "710570411": {
            "id": "710570411",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "But Uncle He's been trapped down here all these years with nothing else to eat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570412"
            ]
          },
          "710570412": {
            "id": "710570412",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "How am I supposed to face his family with him in this state?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570415"
            ]
          },
          "710570415": {
            "id": "710570415",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Now that you mention it, Khedive might be able to help. After all, he's a scholar from Sumeru. He must've conducted some research on mushrooms.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570416"
            ]
          },
          "710570416": {
            "id": "710570416",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About Khedive...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570417"
            ]
          },
          "710570417": {
            "id": "710570417",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "He's still in the camp above. He said he wanted to organize his research materials and bring them down here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570418"
            ]
          },
          "710570418": {
            "id": "710570418",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "We'll just have to wait till then to ask him about the situation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570419"
            ]
          },
          "710570419": {
            "id": "710570419",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon hopes that Uncle He will recover.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570420"
            ]
          },
          "710570420": {
            "id": "710570420",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "He's a veteran miner, and an agile one, too. He took very good care of youngsters who were new in the mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570421"
            ]
          },
          "710570421": {
            "id": "710570421",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "When he went missing a few years back, everyone wondered why Rex Lapis didn't protect him. A good man's life shouldn't have ended that way, they said.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570422"
            ]
          },
          "710570422": {
            "id": "710570422",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "I'm sure everyone'll be elated to see him recover and return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570423"
            ]
          },
          "710570423": {
            "id": "710570423",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, you have my thanks. Once Khedive is done checking on Uncle He, I'll get him out of The Chasm — I will, whatever happens.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570424"
            ]
          },
          "710570424": {
            "id": "710570424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "Thank you so much. I really don't know how I can repay you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7105705",
      "subQuestName": "Black Screen Conversation with Uncle He",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7105706",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Uncle He",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710570201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710570201": {
            "id": "710570201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He took them all out in a whoosh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570202"
            ]
          },
          "710570202": {
            "id": "710570202",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! So strong!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570203"
            ]
          },
          "710570203": {
            "id": "710570203",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "Hee-hee... Mushroom meat, mushroom meat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570204"
            ]
          },
          "710570204": {
            "id": "710570204",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "Ever since I started eating mushroom meat, my lower back pain left me and I got more strength. Hee-hee, it's like I've grown a few years younger!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570205"
            ]
          },
          "710570205": {
            "id": "710570205",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "And mushroom creatures are more delicious than mushroom meat! The bigger, the tastier... Hee-hee...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570206"
            ]
          },
          "710570206": {
            "id": "710570206",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Could it be that Uncle He got so strong from eating mushroom meat?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570207"
            ]
          },
          "710570207": {
            "id": "710570207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, since it might grant us more power, why don't we give it a whirl?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570209",
              "710570211"
            ]
          },
          "710570209": {
            "id": "710570209",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon just wants to see how it tastes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570212"
            ]
          },
          "710570212": {
            "id": "710570212",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But back on topic, Uncle He should be fine with following us back now, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570213"
            ]
          },
          "710570213": {
            "id": "710570213",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "Mushroom meat... Hee-hee, yummy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570214"
            ]
          },
          "710570214": {
            "id": "710570214",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uncle He, let's go back to the camp together!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570215"
            ]
          },
          "710570215": {
            "id": "710570215",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "Huh? \"Together\"? Sure, let's have the mushroom meat together. Hee-hee, air-dried mushroom meat can be stored for a long, long time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570216"
            ]
          },
          "710570216": {
            "id": "710570216",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon means we're going back to the camp together!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570217"
            ]
          },
          "710570217": {
            "id": "710570217",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Uncle He",
            "text": "The \"damp\"? What got damp? Oh, what does it matter? I'm fine with it... Hee-hee, now that I've eaten mushroom meat, damp or dry, I can go anywhere!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570218"
            ]
          },
          "710570218": {
            "id": "710570218",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710570219"
            ]
          },
          "710570219": {
            "id": "710570219",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, let's bring Uncle He back to see Jinwu."
          },
          "710570211": {
            "id": "710570211",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, alright, Paimon gets it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7105707",
